      <abstract id="aspace_c76900e449c09d57f5529e98c0d049ec">Harm Buning (1922-2006) was a Professor of Aerospace Engineering in the University of Michigan School of Engineering. This collection consists of the professional records of Harm Buning, primarily documenting his activities at the University of Michigan and at NASA.</abstract>
